隠さないで ちゃんと教えて
Don't hide it, tell me properly

453
00:32:06,308 --> 00:32:10,608
君のこと全部ちょうだい
Give me everything about you

454
00:32:11,808 --> 00:32:14,808
聴いて 会いたいのに飛んでって
Listen, I want to see you so much I could fly to you

455
00:32:15,008 --> 00:32:19,308
困るくらいにお願い
Please, so much that it's overwhelming

456
00:32:19,608 --> 00:32:25,008
高鳴る心 聴いてみて 感じてほしいの
Listen to my throbbing heart, I want you to feel it

457
00:32:25,808 --> 00:32:29,008
会いたいわ すぐ飛んでって
I want to see you, I'll fly to you right away

458
00:32:29,308 --> 00:32:33,608
困るくらいにお願い
Please, so much that it's overwhelming

459
00:32:33,608 --> 00:32:36,608
ねぇ ちゃんと聞いてみて 受け取って
Hey, listen closely and take this in

460
